OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fshowers through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, heavy at times. Strong to
OL,8,Fgale force westerly winds over Orkney
OL,9,Fwill ease a touch, but winds
OL,10,Fstrengthen for Shetland overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,13,Fsome showers, becoming lighter and
OL,14,Fmore isolated through the day. Strong
OL,15,Fwesterly winds at first will steadily
OL,16,Fease through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
