OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith rain and then showers on Sunday.
OL,7,FSunny spells then showers developing
OL,8,Fon Monday. Windy with a few showers on
OL,9,FTuesday.
